    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Stack health at a glance",
      "id": 14,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "node_exporter",
      "description": "0 while the host exporter answers its scrape, 1 when it has no series at all. That is the difference between a box that is down and a box that stopped being scraped, and every host number in the bundle comes from this exporter, so a 1 here is why the host pages read empty rather than red.",
      "id": 15,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(absent(node_exporter_build_info{job=\"node_exporter\"}) or vector(0))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "missing",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "id": "liveness",
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "ok", "color": "green" },
                "1": { "text": "missing", "color": "red" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "cAdvisor",
      "description": "0 while cAdvisor publishes its version series, 1 when it publishes nothing. A 1 means every per-container number in the bundle is missing rather than idle, so this is the first tile to rule out when the Containers page goes blank.",
      "id": 16,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(absent(cadvisor_version_info{job=\"cadvisor\"}) or vector(0))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "missing",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "id": "liveness",
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "ok", "color": "green" },
                "1": { "text": "missing", "color": "red" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "blackbox (Sparks)",
      "description": "The health probe over each Spark's health endpoint, held at 0 while no Spark is enrolled, which is what ships: no target groups, nothing to probe, nothing to alarm on. A 1 means the generated target file does have boxes enrolled while the prober answers nothing, so read it as the probe layer being wrong rather than the boxes being offline.",
      "id": 17,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "((absent(probe_success{job=\"blackbox-spark\"}) and on() (count(up{job=\"spark-node\"}) > 0)) or vector(0))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "missing",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "id": "liveness",
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "ok", "color": "green" },
                "1": { "text": "missing", "color": "red" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "blackbox (models)",
      "description": "The HTTP probe against each Spark's model-serving port, gated the same way so an unenrolled fleet reads 0. A 0 with every model panel empty means the probes are fine and the backends are the ones not answering; a 1 means the probe layer itself is silent.",
      "id": 18,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "((absent(probe_success{job=\"blackbox-spark-models\"}) and on() (count(up{job=\"spark-node\"}) > 0)) or vector(0))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "missing",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "id": "liveness",
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "ok", "color": "green" },
                "1": { "text": "missing", "color": "red" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alerts firing",
      "description": "Series Prometheus currently holds in state firing. Anything above 0 should have a reason written down somewhere, and the Alerts page names them.",
      "id": 19,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Containers",
      "description": "Distinct container names cAdvisor has reported, so a compose service that was never started is simply absent from this count rather than reading zero.",
      "id": 20,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 11 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(count by (name) (container_last_seen))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets up",
      "description": "Scrape targets answering out of the total below. The count, not the ratio, is what to read: this stack's target list grows with the Spark fleet.",
      "id": 21,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(up == 1)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Targets configured",
      "description": "Every target Prometheus believes it should be scraping. If this number moves without a Spark joining or leaving, someone edited a scrape config or a file-SD document.",
      "id": 22,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count(up)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "none", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "noValue": "0", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape freshness",
      "description": "Seconds since the most recent successful scrape of any target, against the 15s scrape_interval in observability/prometheus/prometheus.yml: past a couple of intervals, Prometheus is behind rather than the exporters being quiet.",
      "id": 23,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(time() - timestamp(up))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": { "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "textMode": "auto", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "noValue": "n/a", "mappings": [] }, "overrides": [] },
      "thresholds": {
        "mode": "absolute",
        "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 30 }, { "color": "red", "value": 90 } ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Bundle",
      "id": 24,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
